      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roeland_Park%2C_Kansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Missouri and Kansas Interurban Railway ran through Roeland Park, linking Rosedale to downtown Overland Park.",
